                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "JumpJet Rex does such a great job of blending accessible, pick-up-and-play levels with hard as nails challenges and optional objectives, that it's hard to think of who this game ISN'T for. I loved the art style, tongue in cheek writing, and the super responsive controls. \n\nEasy recommend for any old school platforming fans, or even fans of newer games like Super Meat Boy.",
